{"parse": {"title": "Damage Affinities / Elements", "pageid": 2362, "revid": 45760, "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"thumb  \" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 80px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/d5/C5736022-3266-4C52-80F8-0BB6E457AEA1.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230203010737\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"C5736022-3266-4C52-80F8-0BB6E457AEA1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/d5/C5736022-3266-4C52-80F8-0BB6E457AEA1.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/80?cb=20230203010737\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"36\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"C5736022-3266-4C52-80F8-0BB6E457AEA1.jpg\" data-image-key=\"C5736022-3266-4C52-80F8-0BB6E457AEA1.jpg\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>Damage Affinities are primary/secondary attacks of a specific units. They matter because in portals/legend stages each enemy has a resistance and weakness. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Icons_and_Symbols\">Icons and Symbols</span></h2>\n<ul><li>In any Portal/Legend Stage there are enemies with resistances and weaknesses.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>The damage affinity icon with a percent represents how much additional damage you would deal with that specific affinity</li></ul>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-center show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/d5/C5736022-3266-4C52-80F8-0BB6E457AEA1.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230203010737\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"C5736022-3266-4C52-80F8-0BB6E457AEA1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/d5/C5736022-3266-4C52-80F8-0BB6E457AEA1.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20230203010737\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"81\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"C5736022-3266-4C52-80F8-0BB6E457AEA1.jpg\" data-image-key=\"C5736022-3266-4C52-80F8-0BB6E457AEA1.jpg\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:C5736022-3266-4C52-80F8-0BB6E457AEA1.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<ul><li>The picture above represents 150 Physical Resistance and 30% Magic Weakness, meaning they would take less damage when using a physical unit and they would take extra damage from magic units.</li>\n<li>Weaknesses appear as an icon with a percentage above the enemy's health bar. Weakness increases damage received by X%, so an enemy with 30% Magic Weakness means units with the Magic trait will deal 30% more damage to them. For example: A <span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"color: #ffabab; text-shadow: 0 0 2px #fc0b0b, 0 0 2px #fc0b0b, 0 0 2px #fc0b0b;\">Physical </span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/8/81/Damage_type_Physical.png/revision/latest?cb=20221113212653\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Damage type Physical\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/8/81/Damage_type_Physical.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20221113212653\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Damage type Physical.png\" data-image-key=\"Damage_type_Physical.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>/<span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"color: #FFB2E6; text-shadow: 0 0 2px #FF66CC, 0 0 2px #FF66CC, 0 0 2px #FF66CC;\">Rose </span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/8/87/Damage_type_Rose.png/revision/latest?cb=20230621053604\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Damage type Rose\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Damage type Rose.png\" data-image-key=\"Damage_type_Rose.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/8/87/Damage_type_Rose.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20230621053604\" /></a></span> Unit that deals 10000 Damage against an enemy that has a 400% boost to <span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"color: #ffabab; text-shadow: 0 0 2px #fc0b0b, 0 0 2px #fc0b0b, 0 0 2px #fc0b0b;\">Physical </span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/8/81/Damage_type_Physical.png/revision/latest?cb=20221113212653\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Damage type Physical\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Damage type Physical.png\" data-image-key=\"Damage_type_Physical.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/8/81/Damage_type_Physical.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20221113212653\" /></a></span> damage, and a 150% boost to <span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"color: #FFB2E6; text-shadow: 0 0 2px #FF66CC, 0 0 2px #FF66CC, 0 0 2px #FF66CC;\">Rose </span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/8/87/Damage_type_Rose.png/revision/latest?cb=20230621053604\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Damage type Rose\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Damage type Rose.png\" data-image-key=\"Damage_type_Rose.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/8/87/Damage_type_Rose.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20230621053604\" /></a></span> damage, will deal (10000)x(1.00+4.00+1.50) damage to the enemy, which equals 65000 damage.</li>\n<li>Damage resistance appears as a shield above the enemy's health bar. Resistance reduces damage by <i>100 / (100 + Resistance),</i> so an enemy with 150 Magic Resistance will only take 40% Magic Damage. Damage Penetration <i>reduces</i> Resistance.</li></ul>\n<hr />\n<p><br />\n<b>Each Affinity Explained:</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"color: #38fcff; text-shadow: 0 0 2px #0f3efa, 0 0 2px #0f3efa, 0 0 2px #0f3efa;\">Magic </span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/3/3b/Damage_type_Magic.png/revision/latest?cb=20221113212417\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Damage type Magic\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Damage type Magic.png\" data-image-key=\"Damage_type_Magic.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/3/3b/Damage_type_Magic.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20221113212417\" /></a></span> Units that  have supernatural abilities or magical spells.</li>\n<li><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"color: #ffabab; text-shadow: 0 0 2px #fc0b0b, 0 0 2px #fc0b0b, 0 0 2px #fc0b0b;\">Physical </span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/8/81/Damage_type_Physical.png/revision/latest?cb=20221113212653\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Damage type Physical\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Damage type Physical.png\" data-image-key=\"Damage_type_Physical.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/8/81/Damage_type_Physical.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20221113212653\" /></a></span> Units that use their hands or weapons with natural abilities.</li>\n<li><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"color: black; text-shadow: 0 0 3px white, 0 0 2px white, 0 0 2px white, 0 0 2px black;\">True </span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/a/a7/Damage_type_True.png/revision/latest?cb=20221113234142\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Damage type True\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Damage type True.png\" data-image-key=\"Damage_type_True.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/a/a7/Damage_type_True.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20221113234142\" /></a></span> - Units with True Damage ignore type resistances on enemies, dealing the full damage to them without having it reduced by resistance. True damage also ignores damage resistance from enemies with the ice attribute.</li>\n<li><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"color: #ffab19; text-shadow: 0 0 2px #fe2a00, 0 0 2px #fe2a00, 0 0 2px #fe2a00;\">Fire </span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/8/85/Damage_type_Fire.png/revision/latest?cb=20221113212417\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Damage type Fire\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Damage type Fire.png\" data-image-key=\"Damage_type_Fire.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/8/85/Damage_type_Fire.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20221113212417\" /></a></span> - Units with the element of Fire, most fire units have the ability to <b>burn</b> enemies, reducing their regen by a bit.</li>\n<li><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"color: #00aaff; text-shadow: 0 0 2px #043daf, 0 0 2px #043daf, 0 0 2px #043daf;\">Aqua </span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/4/45/Damage_type_Aqua.png/revision/latest?cb=20230621053532\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Damage type Aqua\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Damage type Aqua.png\" data-image-key=\"Damage_type_Aqua.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/4/45/Damage_type_Aqua.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20230621053532\" /></a></span> - Units with the element of Aqua.</li>\n<li><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"color: #cff2ff; text-shadow: 0 0 2px #0191ff, 0 0 2px #0191ff, 0 0 2px #0191ff;\">Storm </span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/dc/Damage_type_Storm.png/revision/latest?cb=20230621053504\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Damage type Storm\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Damage type Storm.png\" data-image-key=\"Damage_type_Storm.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/dc/Damage_type_Storm.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20230621053504\" /></a></span> -  Units with the element of Storm, most storm units have the ability to freeze/slow enemies.</li>\n<li><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"color: #e7ffd7; text-shadow: 0 0 2px #01c661, 0 0 2px #01c661, 0 0 2px #01c661;\">Air </span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/a/a5/Damage_type_Air.png/revision/latest?cb=20221113212417\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Damage type Air\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Damage type Air.png\" data-image-key=\"Damage_type_Air.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/a/a5/Damage_type_Air.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20221113212417\" /></a></span> - Units with the element of Air.</li>\n<li><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"color: #FFB2E6; text-shadow: 0 0 2px #FF66CC, 0 0 2px #FF66CC, 0 0 2px #FF66CC;\">Rose </span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/8/87/Damage_type_Rose.png/revision/latest?cb=20230621053604\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Damage type Rose\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Damage type Rose.png\" data-image-key=\"Damage_type_Rose.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/8/87/Damage_type_Rose.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20230621053604\" /></a></span> - Units with the element of Rose.</li>\n<li><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"color: #6d6da3; text-shadow: 0 0 2px #27003a, 0 0 2px #27003a, 0 0 2px #27003a;\">Dark </span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/3/32/Damage_type_Dark.png/revision/latest?cb=20221113230911\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Damage type Dark\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Damage type Dark.png\" data-image-key=\"Damage_type_Dark.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/3/32/Damage_type_Dark.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20221113230911\" /></a></span> - Units with the element of Dark.</li>\n<li><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"color: #fffbc9; text-shadow: 0 0 2px #c3c135, 0 0 2px #c3c135, 0 0 2px #c3c135;\">Light </span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/2/22/Damage_type_Light.png/revision/latest?cb=20221113230903\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Damage type Light\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Damage type Light.png\" data-image-key=\"Damage_type_Light.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/2/22/Damage_type_Light.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20221113230903\" /></a></span> - Units with the element of Light.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Tips\">Tips</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Whenever you collect a portal, always check out the affinity icon showing their weakness. Try to use units with the affinity shown to complete the portal easier.</li>\n<li>It is best to use Physical Units on Legend Stages with Magic Resistances, It is same for the Magical Units.</li>\n<li>It is always best to use the recommended Affinities in challenges.</li>\n<li>Always use relics to boost your units damage or penetration to resistances or PWR to increase DPS (It would be useful if your unit is weak because of resistances)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Buffs\">Buffs</span></h2>\n<p>Certain units have the ability to create damage buffs that significantly increases a unit's damage/DPS.\n</p><p>They would be very useful especially for portals, legend stages and challenges.  Due to enemies with weaknesses or resistances.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Megomu_(Chimera_Shadow)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Megomu (Chimera Shadow)\">Megomu (Chimera Shadow)</a> can buff magic damage taken by an enemy by <b>30%</b></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Blackhair\" title=\"Blackhair\">Blackhair</a> can buff magic damage taken by an enemy by <b>15%</b></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Commander\" title=\"Commander\">Commander</a>'s ability can buff physical units' damage by <b>25%(Stackable)</b> for a limited time</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Wenda\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Wenda\">Wenda</a>'s ability can buff magical units' damage by <b>30%(Stackable)</b> for a limited time</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Merlyn_(Infinity)\" title=\"Merlyn (Infinity)\">Merlyn (Infinity)</a>'s Hexed passive can buff magic damage taken by an enemy by 30% (permanent)</li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Sukuno (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvU3VrdW5vP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Sukuno</span> and <a href=\"/wiki/Switchblade_(Deception)\" title=\"Switchblade (Deception)\">Switchblade</a>'s <b>dismember</b> passive can buff physical damage taken by an enemy by <b>25%</b> (permanent)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Griffin_(Reincarnation)\" title=\"Griffin (Reincarnation)\">Griffin (Ascension)</a> passively buffs <b>ALL</b> units, including other players' units, by <b>100%</b>. (permanent)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Oshy\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Oshy\">Oshy</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Oshy_(Idol)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Oshy (Idol)\">and her evolution</a> passively buffs <b>ALL</b> units, but not including other players' units, depending on its upgrade (permanent).</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Chuuni_(Delusion)\" title=\"Chuuni (Delusion)\">Chuuni (Delusion)</a> can buff magic damage taken by an enemy by <b>50%(Stackable)</b> until she is no longer targetting the enemy.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018010403\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.022 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.056 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 328/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 6006/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 70/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   30.805      1 -total\n 98.53%   30.352     14 Template:Damage_Type\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_animeadventures853:pcache:idhash:2362-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261018010403 and revision id 45760. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>", "images": ["C5736022-3266-4C52-80F8-0BB6E457AEA1.jpg", "Damage_type_Physical.png", "Damage_type_Rose.png", "Damage_type_Magic.png", "Damage_type_True.png", "Damage_type_Fire.png", "Damage_type_Aqua.png", "Damage_type_Storm.png", "Damage_type_Air.png", "Damage_type_Dark.png", "Damage_type_Light.png"], "sections": [{"toclevel": 1, "level": "2", "line": "Icons and Symbols", "number": "1", "index": "1", "fromtitle": "Damage_Affinities_/_Elements", "byteoffset": 222, "anchor": "Icons_and_Symbols", "linkAnchor": "Icons_and_Symbols"}, {"toclevel": 1, "level": "2", "line": "Tips", "number": "2", "index": "2", "fromtitle": "Damage_Affinities_/_Elements", "byteoffset": 2460, "anchor": "Tips", "linkAnchor": "Tips"}, {"toclevel": 1, "level": "2", "line": "Buffs", "number": "3", "index": "3", "fromtitle": "Damage_Affinities_/_Elements", "byteoffset": 2975, "anchor": "Buffs", "linkAnchor": "Buffs"}], "showtoc": false, "displaytitle": "<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Damage Affinities / Elements</span>"}, "_provenance": {"url": "https://animeadventures.fandom.com/api.php?action=parse&oldid=45760&prop=text%7Cimages%7Csections%7Cdisplaytitle&format=json&formatversion=2&disableeditsection=1", "fetched_at": "2026-10-23T13:25:22.585673+00:00", "sha256": "8b3bba91eecb6f615d10e425cd57f2d5168ca2b4077d04e3f3920f5eba19cc1e"}}